  "summary_en": "Canada's 2026 national AI strategy, built on six pillars: protection, empowerment, adoption, sovereign infrastructure, national champions and trusted alliances. It is mainly about adoption, sovereignty and trust. Manufacturing and robotics, transport and autonomous systems, and agriculture are named priority sectors. Robot-specific governance is minimal.",
